  triviaText: {fileID: 2089938934}
  facts:
  - The Holocene is the only epoch where climate is driven by humans, not the Sun
    or volcanoes.
  - Humanity has altered more land in the last 70 years than in the previous 11,000
    years of the Holocene.
  - Since 1970 we have lost 69 % of all wild vertebrate populations - we live in
    the Sixth Mass Extinction.
  - Over 300 mammal species have gone extinct in the Holocene - faster than ever
    before.
  - "The Holocene may become the shortest epoch in Earth\u2019s history - we are
    ending it right now."
